  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "- I'd love to see something like toggles to change the quick menu/normal menu color! i love the green but it can be kind of bland.\n- ways to put filters over worlds so that they don't seem so bright! Something like the screen brightness slider on iphones and androids :) \n- ways to play with spotify while in the game! i've seen people discussing how they can't use spotify anymore while in-game and i'd love for a way to use it while i'm just chilling in my home world.\n- flight in normal worlds! force disabled for worlds like among us or murder 4.\n- avatar resizer, so you can be a big or little  :)\n- ways to hide people entirely without having to block them.",
